      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 12: a second rider — the frozen ε estimator survives the transfer",
      "text": "The frozen rider-1 estimator survives the transfer: ε_coast − 0.13 beats even P. Paz's own best flat constant by ~34% (RMS 0.096 vs 0.145 at s̄ ≥ 3%, n = 161); the −0.13 offset reproduces independently (measured gap 0.12); the energy law lands ~5–7% median with only mass data-implied (per-ride median m̂ 74.5 kg), and ε_geom is the best variant (+0.6% bias) on this open, coastable corpus.",
      "appearance": [
        {
          "@id": "https://github.com/danlessa/bicycling-energy-model/blob/main/research/journal/MODEL_COMPARISON_JOURNAL.md"
        }
      ],
      "subjectOf": {
